2026-10-29T19:33:02.8630690Z   the master secret derived from the early one is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8713450Z   Finished keyed without its label is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8744600Z   the sequence number XORed into the nonce's front is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8774940Z   a record's length in its additional data left out is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8803810Z   the server's Finished unchecked is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8832330Z   CertificateVerify unchecked is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8865470Z   CertificateVerify over the client's context string is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.8968970Z   an ECDSA scheme taken for any curve is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9019490Z   an Ed25519 CertificateVerify unchecked is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9060760Z   a server's Certificate of any length searched is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9084530Z   a client's handshake bounded by each wait alone is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9115490Z   a KeyUpdate's request taken whatever it is is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9191070Z   handshake bytes after the ServerHello taken under the keys is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9241690Z   a leaf whose keyUsage forbids signing taken is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9272150Z   a client Certificate past 2^14 bytes sent in one record is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9306890Z   a read past its timeout taken as the connection's end is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9338580Z   a KeyUpdate's request never answered is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9376330Z   no new keys at the key limit is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9403990Z   key_update(true) sent as a KeyUpdate asking nothing is caught
2026-10-29T19:33:02.9431670Z   a CertificateRequest's context taken in the handshake is caught
